{"seq":3,"slug":"local-scheduled-notifications","title":"本地通知与定时调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/implementation/local-scheduled-notifications","wordCount":1308,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"本地通知与定时调度\">本地通知与定时调度</h1><p>本地通知由设备端直接触发，无需经过远程推送服务器和平台网关。它的典型应用场景——闹钟提醒、待办到期、日历事件、地理围栏触发——都具有&quot;触发条件在本地可确定&quot;的共同特征。与远程推送的 at-most-once 语义不同，本地通知在设备端调度，不受网络状态和推送配额限制，送达可靠性接近 100%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>UNNotificationRequest</strong>（iOS）：本地通知的核心对象，由 identifier + content + trigger 三部分组成</li>\n<li><strong>Trigger 类型</strong>：时间间隔触发（TimeInterval）、日历匹配触发（Calendar）、地理围栏触发（Location）</li>\n<li><strong>AlarmManager</strong>（Android）：系统级精确定时唤醒机制，用于在指定时间触发 BroadcastReceiver</li>\n<li><strong>WorkManager</strong>（Android）：Google 推荐的后台任务调度器，支持约束条件和延迟执行</li>\n<li><strong>Chain Scheduling</strong>：Android 上的链式自调度模式——每次触发后立即设置下一次闹钟</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ios-本地通知体系\">iOS 本地通知体系</h2><p>iOS 通过 <code>UserNotifications</code> 框架统一管理本地和远程通知。本地通知的核心组件是 <code>UNNotificationRequest</code>，由三部分组成：identifier、content、trigger。</p>\n<h3 id=\"触发器类型\">触发器类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Trigger 类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>UNTimeIntervalNotificationTrigger</code></td>\n<td>延迟指定秒数后触发</td>\n<td>倒计时、延时提醒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UNCalendarNotificationTrigger</code></td>\n<td>匹配日期组件时触发</td>\n<td>每日定时、生日提醒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UNLocationNotificationTrigger</code></td>\n<td>进入/离开地理区域时触发</td>\n<td>到店提醒、签到</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"let content = UNMutableNotificationContent()&#10;content.title = &quot;会议提醒&quot;&#10;content.body = &quot;产品评审会议将在15分钟后开始&quot;&#10;content.sound = .default&#10;content.categoryIdentifier = &quot;MEETING_REMINDER&quot;&#10;&#10;var dateComponents = DateComponents()&#10;dateComponents.hour = 9&#10;dateComponents.minute = 45&#10;let trigger = UNCalendarNotificationTrigger(dateMatching: dateComponents, repeats: true)&#10;&#10;let request = UNNotificationRequest(identifier: &quot;daily-standup&quot;, content: content, trigger: trigger)&#10;UNUserNotificationCenter.current().add(request)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> content </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UNMutableNotificationContent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">content.title </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"会议提醒\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">content.body </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"产品评审会议将在15分钟后开始\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">content.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sound</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .default</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">content.categoryIdentifier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"MEETING_REMINDER\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dateComponents </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DateComponents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dateComponents.hour </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dateComponents.minute </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 45</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trigger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UNCalendarNotificationTrigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dateMatching</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: dateComponents, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">repeats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UNNotificationRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">identifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"daily-standup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: content, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">trigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: trigger)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">UNUserNotificationCenter.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ios-本地通知限制\">iOS 本地通知限制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>限制</th>\n<th>数值</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>挂起通知上限</td>\n<td>64 个/app</td>\n<td>超出后最早的被静默移除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复最小间隔</td>\n<td>60 秒</td>\n<td><code>repeats: true</code> 时 trigger 间隔不能小于 1 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Location trigger 区域上限</td>\n<td>20 个/app（系统全局共享）</td>\n<td>需要精确管理区域注册</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知权限</td>\n<td>必须用户授权</td>\n<td>本地通知也受 <code>UNAuthorizationStatus</code> 约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"管理挂起通知\">管理挂起通知</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"let center = UNUserNotificationCenter.current()&#10;center.getPendingNotificationRequests { requests in&#10;    // 查看所有已调度但未触发的通知&#10;}&#10;center.removePendingNotificationRequests(withIdentifiers: [&quot;daily-standup&quot;])&#10;center.removeAllPendingNotificationRequests()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> center </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UNUserNotificationCenter.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">center.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">getPendingNotificationRequests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { requests </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 查看所有已调度但未触发的通知</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">center.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">removePendingNotificationRequests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">withIdentifiers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"daily-standup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">center.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">removeAllPendingNotificationRequests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"android-本地通知调度\">Android 本地通知调度</h2><p>Android 没有与 iOS 等价的&quot;本地通知&quot;统一 API。本地通知的调度需要组合使用 <code>AlarmManager</code>（精确定时唤醒）+ <code>NotificationManager</code>（构建并展示通知）。Android 12+ 还可以使用 <code>WorkManager</code> 的精确调度能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"alarmmanager-方案\">AlarmManager 方案</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[应用设置提醒] --&gt; B[AlarmManager.setExactAndAllowWhileIdle]&#10;    B --&gt; C[系统在指定时间触发 BroadcastReceiver]&#10;    C --&gt; D[BroadcastReceiver.onReceive]&#10;    D --&gt; E[构建 Notification + notify]\">graph TD\n    A[应用设置提醒] --&gt; B[AlarmManager.setExactAndAllowWhileIdle]\n    B --&gt; C[系统在指定时间触发 BroadcastReceiver]\n    C --&gt; D[BroadcastReceiver.onReceive]\n    D --&gt; E[构建 Notification + notify]</pre><p>Android 12（API 31）引入 <code>SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM</code> 权限，Android 14（API 34）进一步将其限制为需要用户主动授予：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"if (Build.VERSION.SDK_INT &gt;= Build.VERSION_CODES.S) {&#10;    val alarmManager = getSystemService(AlarmManager::class.java)&#10;    if (!alarmManager.canScheduleExactAlarms()) {&#10;        // 引导用户到设置页授权&#10;        startActivity(Intent(Settings.ACTION_REQUEST_SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>if (Build.VERSION.SDK_INT >= Build.VERSION_CODES.S) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val alarmManager = getSystemService(AlarmManager::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (!alarmManager.canScheduleExactAlarms()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 引导用户到设置页授权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        startActivity(Intent(Settings.ACTION_REQUEST_SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"workmanager-方案-android-14-推荐\">WorkManager 方案（Android 14+ 推荐）</h3><p>对于不需要精确到秒的提醒场景，WorkManager 提供更可靠的调度（不会被 Doze 模式完全阻塞）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val reminderWork = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&lt;ReminderWorker&gt;()&#10;    .setInitialDelay(Duration.ofHours(2))&#10;    .setConstraints(Constraints.Builder()&#10;        .setRequiresBatteryNotLow(true)&#10;        .build())&#10;    .addTag(&quot;reminder_meeting_123&quot;)&#10;    .build()&#10;&#10;WorkManager.getInstance(context)&#10;    .enqueueUniqueWork(&quot;meeting_123&quot;, ExistingWorkPolicy.REPLACE, reminderWork)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val reminderWork = OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder&#x3C;ReminderWorker>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .setInitialDelay(Duration.ofHours(2))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .setConstraints(Constraints.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .setRequiresBatteryNotLow(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .addTag(\"reminder_meeting_123\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WorkManager.getInstance(context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .enqueueUniqueWork(\"meeting_123\", ExistingWorkPolicy.REPLACE, reminderWork)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方案选择决策\">方案选择决策</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>闹钟/精确定时</td>\n<td><code>AlarmManager.setExactAndAllowWhileIdle</code></td>\n<td>必须在精确时间触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定期后台同步</td>\n<td><code>WorkManager</code> (periodic)</td>\n<td>系统级保障执行，支持约束条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟任务（非精确）</td>\n<td><code>WorkManager</code> (one-time + delay)</td>\n<td>不消耗精确闹钟配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理围栏</td>\n<td><code>GeofencingClient</code> + BroadcastReceiver</td>\n<td>专用 API，精度高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短延迟（app 在前台）</td>\n<td><code>Handler.postDelayed</code> / 协程 <code>delay</code></td>\n<td>无需系统级调度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"重复调度策略\">重复调度策略</h2><h3 id=\"ios-重复规则\">iOS 重复规则</h3><p>iOS 的 <code>UNCalendarNotificationTrigger</code> 支持灵活的重复模式——通过 <code>DateComponents</code> 组合匹配：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设置的 DateComponents</th>\n<th>重复行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>hour: 8, minute: 0</code></td>\n<td>每天 08:00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>weekday: 2, hour: 9</code></td>\n<td>每周一 09:00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>day: 1, hour: 10</code></td>\n<td>每月 1 日 10:00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>month: 12, day: 25</code></td>\n<td>每年 12 月 25 日</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"android-重复规则\">Android 重复规则</h3><p><code>AlarmManager.setRepeating()</code> / <code>setInexactRepeating()</code> 提供重复闹钟能力。但从 Android 6.0（Doze）开始，<code>setRepeating</code> 的精确性不再被保证。生产环境推荐：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>使用 <code>setExactAndAllowWhileIdle</code> 设置下一次触发</li>\n<li>在触发时的 BroadcastReceiver 中计算并设置再下一次触发</li>\n<li>形成链式自调度（chain scheduling）</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class ReminderReceiver : BroadcastReceiver() {&#10;    override fun onReceive(context: Context, intent: Intent) {&#10;        showNotification(context, intent)&#10;        scheduleNext(context) // 设置下一次触发&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ReminderReceiver : BroadcastReceiver() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onReceive(context: Context, intent: Intent) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        showNotification(context, intent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        scheduleNext(context) // 设置下一次触发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"跨平台本地通知策略\">跨平台本地通知策略</h2><p>构建跨平台应用时，需要统一管理本地通知的调度逻辑：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Business Logic Layer] --&gt; B[Local Notification Scheduler]&#10;    B --&gt; C{Platform}&#10;    C --&gt;|iOS| D[UNNotificationRequest]&#10;    C --&gt;|Android| E[AlarmManager / WorkManager]&#10;    C --&gt;|HarmonyOS| F[notificationManager.publish]&#10;    B --&gt; G[Persistence Layer&lt;br/&gt;SQLite/SharedPrefs]\">graph LR\n    A[Business Logic Layer] --&gt; B[Local Notification Scheduler]\n    B --&gt; C{Platform}\n    C --&gt;|iOS| D[UNNotificationRequest]\n    C --&gt;|Android| E[AlarmManager / WorkManager]\n    C --&gt;|HarmonyOS| F[notificationManager.publish]\n    B --&gt; G[Persistence Layer&lt;br/&gt;SQLite/SharedPrefs]</pre><p><strong>持久化存储</strong>是跨平台方案的关键——用户设备重启后，iOS 的已调度通知由系统维护不会丢失，但 Android 的 AlarmManager 在设备重启后<strong>全部清除</strong>。必须：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>将所有已调度的本地通知持久化到本地数据库</li>\n<li>监听 <code>BOOT_COMPLETED</code> 广播，重启后重新注册所有闹钟</li>\n<li>实现去重逻辑——避免 app 更新或重启后重复注册</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"与远程推送的协作模式\">与远程推送的协作模式</h2><p>本地通知与远程推送不是替代关系，而是互补关系。典型的协作模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>远程推送触发本地调度更新</strong>：服务端推送新的日程数据，app 收到后更新本地通知的时间/内容。这利用了 <a href=\"silent-push-background\">静默推送与后台唤醒</a> 中的后台数据同步能力</li>\n<li><strong>本地通知作为远程推送的降级</strong>：当推送权限被关闭或网络不可达时，对于可预测的提醒（如预约时间），预先在本地调度</li>\n<li><strong>去重与合并</strong>：如果远程推送和本地通知可能针对同一事件同时触发，需要通过 notification identifier 做去重——两者使用相同 identifier 时，后者会替换前者</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"harmonyos-本地通知\">HarmonyOS 本地通知</h2><p>HarmonyOS 通过 <code>@ohos.notificationManager</code> 模块发布本地通知：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import notificationManager from &#39;@ohos.notificationManager&#39;;&#10;&#10;const request: notificationManager.NotificationRequest = {&#10;  id: 1001,&#10;  content: {&#10;    notificationContentType: notificationManager.ContentType.NOTIFICATION_CONTENT_BASIC_TEXT,&#10;    normal: {&#10;      title: &#39;会议提醒&#39;,&#10;      text: &#39;产品评审会将在15分钟后开始&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  deliveryTime: new Date(&#39;2026-07-18T09:45:00&#39;).getTime(),&#10;  isAutoDeletedAfterDelivery: true,&#10;};&#10;notificationManager.publish(request);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notificationManager </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ohos.notificationManager'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> notificationManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NotificationRequest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  content: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    notificationContentType: notificationManager.ContentType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NOTIFICATION_CONTENT_BASIC_TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    normal: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      title: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'会议提醒'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      text: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'产品评审会将在15分钟后开始'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deliveryTime: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-07-18T09:45:00'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  isAutoDeletedAfterDelivery: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">notificationManager.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>HarmonyOS 的定时触发依赖 <code>reminderAgentManager</code>（提醒代理），支持倒计时、日历和闹钟三种提醒类型，系统保障在指定时间触发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本地通知是推送体系中&quot;不依赖网络&quot;的可靠触达手段。iOS 的 UserNotifications 框架提供统一优雅的 API；Android 则需要组合 AlarmManager/WorkManager + NotificationManager。跨平台开发的关键是持久化调度状态——Android 设备重启后闹钟全部清除，必须通过 BOOT_COMPLETED 重新注册。本地通知与远程推送互补而非替代，组合使用能覆盖更多触达场景。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"本地通知与定时调度","id":"本地通知与定时调度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 本地通知体系","id":"ios-本地通知体系"},{"level":3,"text":"触发器类型","id":"触发器类型"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS 本地通知限制","id":"ios-本地通知限制"},{"level":3,"text":"管理挂起通知","id":"管理挂起通知"},{"level":2,"text":"Android 本地通知调度","id":"android-本地通知调度"},{"level":3,"text":"AlarmManager 方案","id":"alarmmanager-方案"},{"level":3,"text":"WorkManager 方案（Android 14+ 推荐）","id":"workmanager-方案-android-14-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"方案选择决策","id":"方案选择决策"},{"level":2,"text":"重复调度策略","id":"重复调度策略"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS 重复规则","id":"ios-重复规则"},{"level":3,"text":"Android 重复规则","id":"android-重复规则"},{"level":2,"text":"跨平台本地通知策略","id":"跨平台本地通知策略"},{"level":2,"text":"与远程推送的协作模式","id":"与远程推送的协作模式"},{"level":2,"text":"HarmonyOS 本地通知","id":"harmonyos-本地通知"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"静默推送与后台唤醒","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/implementation/silent-push-background"},"next":{"title":"送达率优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/delivery-reliability/delivery-optimization"}}